=2 Walkthrough
* Solo mission
* Speak with {n:Pelpopo} at (G-9).
* They will provide you with a {i:Fiendtrapper|Fiendtrapper|19204} and 5 {i:Blank fiend plates|Blank F. Plate|19205}.
* The {i:Fiendtrapper|Fiendtrapper|19204} will not work if you under the effect of {s:Sneak} or {p:Invisible (Status)} or too far away.
* Take pictures of different {p:Yagudos|Category:Yagudo}. {p:Campaign Battle|Category:Campaign Battle} mobs are valid. Picture must be taken from the front of the mob, she will not accept pictures from the back or side of the mob.
* Each picture you take will create a {i:Fiend Plate|Fiend Plate|2560} with the mob's name on it and take up an inventory slot. The exposed {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} do not stack.
* Return to {n:Pelpopo} and trade one {i:Fiend Plate|Fiend Plate|2560} at a time.
* After 3 {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} are accepted, the mission is complete.
* If you have extra {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} after completing the mission they may be used for {p:Deep Cover III (W)}.
* If you have {i:Fiend Plates|Fiend Plate|2560} which were rejected they might be good enough for {p:Deep Cover I (W)}.
* Unused {i:Blank fiend plates|Blank F. Plate|19205} may be utilized for {p:Deep Cover III (W)}.
* You must drop the {i:Fiendtrapper|Fiendtrapper|19204} to start {p:Deep Cover III (W)}.

